사진만으로도 유예확정이 되었기에 갔는데 안되냐하니 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924d8-9643-11ef-8c67-27a30cb0074d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632c2-9643-11ef-8c67-e7df09aecd0f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924d9-9643-11ef-8c67-6b0e0a335935\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632c3-9643-11ef-8c67-f52e13601119\">그게 본인건지 인터넷에 떠도는 사진인지 증명할수 있는게 없다면서 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924da-9643-11ef-8c67-d52c415b9635\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632c4-9643-11ef-8c67-bd4a7cee2058\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924db-9643-11ef-8c67-656b3bb769e6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632c5-9643-11ef-8c67-81859920d3a8\">재난유예든 일반유예든 뭐가 다르냐면서 계속 면박아닌 면박을 받는 느낌이ㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠ </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924dc-9643-11ef-8c67-d73a90bb72e9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632c6-9643-11ef-8c67-15d112eb5d85\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924dd-9643-11ef-8c67-fb3b507ef56e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632c7-9643-11ef-8c67-119113cde56c\">그래도 먼저 재난유예한 사람으로써 일단 코로나양성키트 사진으로 증명하겠다 하고 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924de-9643-11ef-8c67-c326fbed0d6b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632c8-9643-11ef-8c67-87cd08a8db8a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924df-9643-11ef-8c67-214d69f325ef\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632c9-9643-11ef-8c67-c13cd8aaf9bf\">제출하고 나왔네요; 덕분에 상담내내 내가 아는 정보가 틀린건가 아님 변경되었나 멘붕오고.. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924e0-9643-11ef-8c67-538c604f2ab6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632ca-9643-11ef-8c67-0bedccce068f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924e1-9643-11ef-8c67-c9c28db65984\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632cb-9643-11ef-8c67-9bd0e657322c\">체결후 등기가 집으로 발송된다 우편으로 갈거다 사업자등록증은 가져오셨냐 하며 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924e2-9643-11ef-8c67-6b68de350f42\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632cc-9643-11ef-8c67-fff778edbd31\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924e3-9643-11ef-8c67-713d1329ff52\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632cd-9643-11ef-8c67-79c40210e856\">저와 다른 상담에 이 상담사분은 FM 그대로인가 싶다가도 여쭙는 질문에도 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924e4-9643-11ef-8c67-33f28230e058\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632ce-9643-11ef-8c67-630b691f8d37\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924e5-9643-11ef-8c67-0dc0d658195e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632cf-9643-11ef-8c67-4d24b4ade50d\">냉정히 되돌아오는 답변에 내가 아는 정보가 잘못된건지 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924e6-9643-11ef-8c67-27b831b6b50c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632d0-9643-11ef-8c67-7bbd6b6c57db\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924e7-9643-11ef-8c67-69bfbadde8a7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632d1-9643-11ef-8c67-994c978031d4\">확정나기전까진 불안에 살것같고 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924e8-9643-11ef-8c67-3587e505a711\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632d2-9643-11ef-8c67-b3fa1d8a94ea\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924e9-9643-11ef-8c67-dd5625c0d91f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632d3-9643-11ef-8c67-b3017a7c4ced\">먼저 재난유예한 사람으로써 정보공유를 하였어도 불안하네여ㅜㅜ </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924ea-9643-11ef-8c67-d7e80dbabeb6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0632d4-9643-11ef-8c67-bd5b37cb9d83\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924eb-9643-11ef-8c67-c93fd801d57f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0659e5-9643-11ef-8c67-c3bcd5358739\">다른 회원님은 어찌 재난유예를 신청하셨는지 궁금합니다! </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924ec-9643-11ef-8c67-516e90baf7a7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0659e6-9643-11ef-8c67-2beca2069fc5\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-478924ed-9643-11ef-8c67-93527fc1b51b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4a0659e7-9643-11ef-8c67-f9ab371f47ba\">[답변]</span></p><!-- } S